	(text "J1 = card edge plugged into MSX cartridge slot.\nJ2 = 2x25 2.54mm right-angle box header (bottom side, opening at the cartridge top).\nIDC pin N = MSX slot pin N (+5V = IDC 45, 47; odd row toward the card edge).\nSame numbering as Daewoo rear expansion header (verify orientation: docs/expander_v2.md).\nCable: 50-core flat ribbon, both IDC sockets same orientation (pin1-pin1).\nOptional: C1 100uF on +5V near J2 is NOT fitted (keep passive)."
